      "comment": "BEAR HAND (1) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Warragul over 400m behind Doongalla Jessie (23.32) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Form from his last run is proving strong. Ready to return to form. DR. HAROLD (7) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth at Warragul, but was among the placings at Warragul three back. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. MINH TEDDY (2) was among the minors three back at Warragul then missed the frame the last two, but drawn box 2 this time where he has four wins. Well placed here and should do much better. SELECT RONAN (3) will be hard to beat with a drop in trip.",
